{"seq":1,"slug":"culture-and-values","title":"文化与价值观","docCount":7,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/lixiang/culture-and-values","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"product-manager-culture","title":"理想汽车产品经理文化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/lixiang/culture-and-values/product-manager-culture","wordCount":1957,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"user-value-driven","title":"理想汽车用户价值驱动","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/lixiang/culture-and-values/user-value-driven","wordCount":1970,"readingTime":8},{"seq":3,"slug":"pragmatic-efficiency","title":"理想汽车务实高效文化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/lixiang/culture-and-values/pragmatic-efficiency","wordCount":2251,"readingTime":10},{"seq":4,"slug":"li-xiang-leadership","title":"李想的创始人领导力特质","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/lixiang/culture-and-values/li-xiang-leadership","wordCount":2445,"readingTime":10},{"seq":5,"slug":"mission-vision-values","title":"理想汽车使命愿景价值观","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/lixiang/culture-and-values/mission-vision-values","wordCount":2189,"readingTime":9},{"seq":6,"slug":"efficiency-first-culture","title":"效率至上文化：理想汽车的组织运转哲学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/lixiang/culture-and-values/efficiency-first-culture","wordCount":2207,"readingTime":9},{"seq":7,"slug":"family-car-philosophy","title":"\"家庭车\"哲学：从用户场景反推产品定义","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/lixiang/culture-and-values/family-car-philosophy","wordCount":2352,"readingTime":10}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"文化与价值观-简介\">文化与价值观 简介</h1><p>理想汽车的企业文化深深植根于创始人李想的个人理念与互联网产品思维。在新势力造车的竞争格局中，理想汽车形成了一套有辨识度的文化体系——以产品经理思维驱动决策，以用户价值作为一切工作的出发点，以务实高效作为日常执行的准绳。</p>\n<p>本章从三个层面展开对理想汽车文化内核的分析：</p>\n<p><strong>产品经理文化</strong>聚焦于理想汽车将产品定义权交给产品经理而非工程师的独特选择，以及李想本人如何以&quot;首席产品经理&quot;的角色主导产品方向。</p>\n<p><strong>用户价值驱动</strong>解读&quot;创造移动的家，创造幸福的家&quot;这一使命如何从口号落地为产品设计准则，以及家庭用户定位如何贯穿从研发到营销的全链路。</p>\n<p><strong>务实高效文化</strong>剖析理想汽车对内耗的零容忍态度、数据驱动的决策方式，以及&quot;花最少的钱办最大的事&quot;这一朴素但强大的运营哲学。</p>\n<p>理解这三个维度，是理解理想汽车为何能在激烈竞争中保持高效增长的基础。</p>\n"}